@startuml
title AEO-6.1 decision and restart
actor Human
participant CLI
participant Verifier
participant Governance
participant Discovery
database Records
participant Controller
Human -> CLI : Inspect exact evidence and proposed relationship
CLI -> Discovery : Recollect manifest-bound evidence
CLI -> Verifier : Confirm subject, disposition and rationale digest
Verifier -> Governance : Canonical authenticated SID
Governance -> Discovery : Recheck current evidence and policy
Governance -> Records : Serialized transaction: duplicate check, decision and audit
Records -> CLI : Immutable decision ID
Human -> Controller : Explicit same-run resume when independently eligible
Controller -> Discovery : Fresh exact-root collection
Discovery -> Governance : Validate disposition applicability
Governance -> Controller : Scoped result or blocking reason
Controller -> Records : Existing checkpoint machinery and budgets
@enduml
